    <detaileddescription>
<para>allocation failure <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>arena<sp/>=<sp/>cslt::move(cslt::ArenaAllocator::Heap(512,<sp/>false).value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Fill<sp/>arena</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">while<sp/>(arena-&gt;alloc(64).hasValue())<sp/>{<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>This<sp/>will<sp/>fail<sp/>-<sp/>no<sp/>space<sp/>left</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(128);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(!result.hasValue())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::cerr<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;Out<sp/>of<sp/>memory:<sp/>&quot;<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>result.error().what()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;\n&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>alloc_aligned() For custom alignment </para>
</simplesect>
